# Canonical list of CellSwap CKB contract packages to build and stage, one per line.
# Consumed by Makefile, .github/workflows/ci.yml, and docker-build.sh so the build, the
# CI test gate, and the local docker gate always compile the exact same set.
#
# Ordering matters: factory-script is first on purpose. pool-script/build.rs derives
# FACTORY_CODE_HASH from the staged factory-script binary, so factory-script must be built
# and staged to build/release/ before the rest compile. Consumers build the first entry,
# stage it, then build the remaining entries.
#
# Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
factory-script
pool-script
cellswap-otx-lock
lp-token
pool-lock
intent-lock
timelock-lock
token-registry
stake-pool
stake-guard
stake-timelock-guard
vtx-sink-lock
emission-lock
mining-pool
always-success
